From d4c23eeae35f9f321b1e9ba8187966b6c07e9dbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: clsx524 <clsx524@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:46:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] build: resolve dependency submodules from the
 superproject root

The build system now lives in a submodule, so the kernel and external component trees are checked out by the superproject. Add project_root, defaulting to the parent directory or CAIHONG_PROJECT_ROOT, and use it for linux/ and external/ paths. Outputs stay in the build-system tree.
